title: "bayesflow-irt: amortized Bayesian inference for Item Response Theory"
abstract: >-
  A BayesFlow 2.x extension for amortized Bayesian inference in Item Response
  Theory (1PL, 2PL, PCM, GPCM) with equivariant summary networks over
  variable-size response matrices.
type: software
